[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l006","ordinal":260353,"en":"Such was the Kalcha’s state—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l007","ordinal":260354,"en":"A dreadful marvel to behold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l008","ordinal":260355,"en":"In his wrath, he looked able"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l009","ordinal":260356,"en":"To reap the Chinese with his sword;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l010","ordinal":260357,"en":"If he made a move, he looked able"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l011","ordinal":260358,"en":"To swallow every last Chinese man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l012","ordinal":260359,"en":"His gray-wolf ferocity revealed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l013","ordinal":260360,"en":"Such was Kongurbay to behold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l014","ordinal":260361,"en":"“Damn you, Chinese people!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l015","ordinal":260362,"en":"Clamorously worshipping stones,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l016","ordinal":260363,"en":"You have set yourselves above me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l017","ordinal":260364,"en":"Between elder and younger brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l018","ordinal":260365,"en":"You Chinese have come"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l019","ordinal":260366,"en":"And sought to divide us."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l020","ordinal":260367,"en":"Having made me the Kalcha’s seer,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l021","ordinal":260368,"en":"What is it you intended to do?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l022","ordinal":260369,"en":"You snarling Chinese dogs"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l023","ordinal":260370,"en":"Have plainly sought"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l024","ordinal":260371,"en":"To bring about my end;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l025","ordinal":260372,"en":"You sought to destroy the Kalcha"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l026","ordinal":260373,"en":"And depart, you Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l027","ordinal":260374,"en":"Toward the Khakan’s realm."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l028","ordinal":260375,"en":"If you provoke my boundless fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l029","ordinal":260376,"en":"I will strip off your Chinese robes"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l030","ordinal":260377,"en":"And make a splendid slaughter."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l031","ordinal":260378,"en":"If frenzy seizes me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l032","ordinal":260379,"en":"May I perish if I do not settle all your accounts together."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l033","ordinal":260380,"en":"If I stiffen in rage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l034","ordinal":260381,"en":"May I perish if I do not crush your distant fury.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l035","ordinal":260382,"en":"Thus spoke Kongurbay:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l036","ordinal":260383,"en":"“Damn you, men of the Khakan!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l037","ordinal":260384,"en":"Claiming you would set things right, forty seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l038","ordinal":260385,"en":"You have plundered my possessions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0957:b004:l039","ordinal":260386,"en":"And brought this discord upon me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l001","ordinal":260387,"en":"Damn you, seers!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l002","ordinal":260388,"en":"Saying you knew the hardships of the Altai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l003","ordinal":260389,"en":"You told me many tales."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l004","ordinal":260390,"en":"Who would believe your words?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l005","ordinal":260391,"en":"You have become my enemies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l006","ordinal":260392,"en":"You muttering seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l007","ordinal":260393,"en":"You appear as foes in my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l008","ordinal":260394,"en":"Keep far from this path, seers;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l009","ordinal":260395,"en":"Never appear before my eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l010","ordinal":260396,"en":"When I mount for battle, none can humble me;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l011","ordinal":260397,"en":"What man could ever catch"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l012","ordinal":260398,"en":"A winged racehorse?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l013","ordinal":260399,"en":"You have shown hostility"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l014","ordinal":260400,"en":"Toward my kinsman who has returned."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l015","ordinal":260401,"en":"You glared at him with hatred"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l016","ordinal":260402,"en":"When my brother came home."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l017","ordinal":260403,"en":"Our father is Khakan Chilaba;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l018","ordinal":260404,"en":"We wandered astray and grew up apart—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l019","ordinal":260405,"en":"Ask no more about our kinship.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l020","ordinal":260406,"en":"Thus Kongurbay spoke."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l021","ordinal":260407,"en":"His great boots curved at the toes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l022","ordinal":260408,"en":"And his neck arched like a rooster’s."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l023","ordinal":260409,"en":"His spectacles gleamed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l024","ordinal":260410,"en":"While Zulpukor, which cut with every stroke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l025","ordinal":260411,"en":"Flashed upon his wrist."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l026","ordinal":260412,"en":"When he arched back and drew his dagger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l027","ordinal":260413,"en":"From the dagger’s edge"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l028","ordinal":260414,"en":"Sparks rose as large as a nomad’s camp."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l029","ordinal":260415,"en":"Six thousand Chinese san-kaldai"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l030","ordinal":260416,"en":"Stopped without uttering a word."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l031","ordinal":260417,"en":"“Your hearts are hostile and your tongues are venomous;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l032","ordinal":260418,"en":"You Chinese—I bear a grudge against you."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l033","ordinal":260419,"en":"You have set out to block"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l034","ordinal":260420,"en":"My broad and open road;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l035","ordinal":260421,"en":"Falsely claiming to be seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l036","ordinal":260422,"en":"You cunning men have sought somehow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l037","ordinal":260423,"en":"To put my heart in order."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l038","ordinal":260424,"en":"By making my brother a stranger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b003:l039","ordinal":260425,"en":"You have sought your opportune hour."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l001","ordinal":260426,"en":"Saying you wished now to learn"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l002","ordinal":260427,"en":"Of the six-month ordeal,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l003","ordinal":260428,"en":"Look how the ill-omened Manchus"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l004","ordinal":260429,"en":"Have spoken lies."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l005","ordinal":260430,"en":"I chose to listen to your words;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l006","ordinal":260431,"en":"By babbling such nonsense,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l007","ordinal":260432,"en":"Whom have I ever corrupted?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l008","ordinal":260433,"en":"When I stiffen in rage,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l009","ordinal":260434,"en":"I will not leave one of you untouched."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l010","ordinal":260435,"en":"If you boast that you are seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l011","ordinal":260436,"en":"Do not stir my Chinese wrath."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l012","ordinal":260437,"en":"When I rage and storm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l013","ordinal":260438,"en":"I will not leave one of you untouched;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l014","ordinal":260439,"en":"Until now I have endured your conduct."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l015","ordinal":260440,"en":"You have committed countless deeds;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l016","ordinal":260441,"en":"While I continued to spare you,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l017","ordinal":260442,"en":"You brought violence upon my golden head."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l018","ordinal":260443,"en":"I called you clairvoyants, seers,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l019","ordinal":260444,"en":"But you did not do this once—you did it a thousand times;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l020","ordinal":260445,"en":"You passed a judgment no man could bear to hear."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l021","ordinal":260446,"en":"By openly calling him a Burut,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l022","ordinal":260447,"en":"Damn you, swine,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l023","ordinal":260448,"en":"You stirred strife against my brother."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l024","ordinal":260449,"en":"You have grieved me, seers;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l025","ordinal":260450,"en":"Shall I dig your graves?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l026","ordinal":260451,"en":"Shall I fall upon all of you"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l027","ordinal":260452,"en":"And make a glorious slaughter?”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l028","ordinal":260453,"en":"Thus Kongurbay spoke,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l029","ordinal":260454,"en":"Arming himself for battle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l030","ordinal":260455,"en":"Slung his great gun across his body,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l031","ordinal":260456,"en":"And brandished in his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l032","ordinal":260457,"en":"Ready for use, his keen sword."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l033","ordinal":260458,"en":"Such was the rabid Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l034","ordinal":260459,"en":"Hunched in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l035","ordinal":260460,"en":"The hair atop his head standing on end,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l036","ordinal":260461,"en":"Bristling as though he meant"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l037","ordinal":260462,"en":"To slaughter the snarling Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l038","ordinal":260463,"en":"His thoughts dark with rage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0958:b004:l039","ordinal":260464,"en":"The Manchus and their khans—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l001","ordinal":260465,"en":"What is the butcher now?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l002","ordinal":260466,"en":"Albanian different souls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l003","ordinal":260467,"en":"Screaming angrily"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l004","ordinal":260468,"en":"Don't hesitate to call"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l005","ordinal":260469,"en":"Calling his wrestlers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l006","ordinal":260470,"en":"They sing their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l007","ordinal":260471,"en":"Come all of you - he said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l008","ordinal":260472,"en":"\"Your blood from Manchu come,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l009","ordinal":260473,"en":"Er Ezkara everyone come!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l010","ordinal":260474,"en":"I'm getting confused"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l011","ordinal":260475,"en":"Don't stand up Chinese, come to me!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l012","ordinal":260476,"en":"Alien wrestler before me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l013","ordinal":260477,"en":"If a relative is found,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l014","ordinal":260478,"en":"If the conscience is closed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l015","ordinal":260479,"en":"My relative who died at birth"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l016","ordinal":260480,"en":"You are really insulting."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l017","ordinal":260481,"en":"Your blood, your blood,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l018","ordinal":260482,"en":"There will be a black runner,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l019","ordinal":260483,"en":"Don't come to me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l020","ordinal":260484,"en":"Gray than a white horse"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l021","ordinal":260485,"en":"How about a murderer?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l022","ordinal":260486,"en":"This is your father's day."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l023","ordinal":260487,"en":"Agar gold, white silver"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l024","ordinal":260488,"en":"How about a murderer?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l025","ordinal":260489,"en":"Gold and silver"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l026","ordinal":260490,"en":"Let's appreciate the mule,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l027","ordinal":260491,"en":"This is your father's day."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l028","ordinal":260492,"en":"Let's go to Semetei."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l029","ordinal":260493,"en":"Do not quarrel, do not quarrel,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l030","ordinal":260494,"en":"Safe Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l031","ordinal":260495,"en":"Let's go back to our month."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l032","ordinal":260496,"en":"Like a star in the sky"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l033","ordinal":260497,"en":"How come you are gray?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l034","ordinal":260498,"en":"O murderer of the world"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l035","ordinal":260499,"en":"How are you a friend?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l036","ordinal":260500,"en":"Tulpar steam to kerem"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l037","ordinal":260501,"en":"How are you?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l038","ordinal":260502,"en":"Kokjal Manas Day -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b003:l039","ordinal":260503,"en":"To draw a runner"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l001","ordinal":260504,"en":"How did you give?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l002","ordinal":260505,"en":"Meet the murderer"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l003","ordinal":260506,"en":"Give a good day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l004","ordinal":260507,"en":"See you in a field"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l005","ordinal":260508,"en":"Faced from a hill,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l006","ordinal":260509,"en":"Let's save Kakan."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l007","ordinal":260510,"en":"Don't mess up, don't fight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l008","ordinal":260511,"en":"General Chinese-Kakanchi"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l009","ordinal":260512,"en":"Let's go back to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l010","ordinal":260513,"en":"Walking a hard way without stopping,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l011","ordinal":260514,"en":"Let's walk the right path."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l012","ordinal":260515,"en":"Reconciliation is for the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l013","ordinal":260516,"en":"Let's tell the blood."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l014","ordinal":260517,"en":"Don't mess up, don't fight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l015","ordinal":260518,"en":"We will return to the people safely."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l016","ordinal":260519,"en":"Forty blood people gathered,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l017","ordinal":260520,"en":"Troubled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l018","ordinal":260521,"en":"The moon has waned, the sun has passed,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l019","ordinal":260522,"en":"How many years have passed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l020","ordinal":260523,"en":"We spent six months without stopping,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l021","ordinal":260524,"en":"Or not being able to overcome the storm,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l022","ordinal":260525,"en":"Or not going to Beijing safely,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l023","ordinal":260526,"en":"Stand firm."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l024","ordinal":260527,"en":"We quarreled,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l025","ordinal":260528,"en":"There was no benefit at all."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l026","ordinal":260529,"en":"Know what I mean,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l027","ordinal":260530,"en":"Thick Chinese-Kakanchi"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l028","ordinal":260531,"en":"Don't be angry, take my tongue!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l029","ordinal":260532,"en":"The people died, the people did not die"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l030","ordinal":260533,"en":"I will save my father,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l031","ordinal":260534,"en":"The country is divided and the population does not die,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l032","ordinal":260535,"en":"I will return to Beijing safely."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l033","ordinal":260536,"en":"This is your father's day,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l034","ordinal":260537,"en":"It's a complete blasphemy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l035","ordinal":260538,"en":"Kan Semetey to the hero"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l036","ordinal":260539,"en":"Let me draw my black horse."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l037","ordinal":260540,"en":"Hear your strength in crimson,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l038","ordinal":260541,"en":"Listen to the stone-throwing stone\" -"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0959:b004:l039","ordinal":260542,"en":"Saying, then Konurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l001","ordinal":260543,"en":"He spoke angrily."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l002","ordinal":260544,"en":"Anger Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l003","ordinal":260545,"en":"He frowned in shame."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l004","ordinal":260546,"en":"A man with a green beard"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l005","ordinal":260547,"en":"The moon ruled the universe"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l006","ordinal":260548,"en":"All twelve members are fingers."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l007","ordinal":260549,"en":"A merciless man"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l008","ordinal":260550,"en":"Screaming in anger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l009","ordinal":260551,"en":"Among the population,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l010","ordinal":260552,"en":"Calling my grandfather to come."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l011","ordinal":260553,"en":"You are great, you are beautiful,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l012","ordinal":260554,"en":"Will it be a blessing?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l013","ordinal":260555,"en":"You are a warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l014","ordinal":260556,"en":"Listen to my words,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l015","ordinal":260557,"en":"My eyes to see."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l016","ordinal":260558,"en":"You are my brother,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l017","ordinal":260559,"en":"Almambet's chunak"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l018","ordinal":260560,"en":"If you are angry, you will swallow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l019","ordinal":260561,"en":"You are a black ear."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l020","ordinal":260562,"en":"Hey, Kulchoro, listen to me,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l021","ordinal":260563,"en":"If you are a hero, if you are a man,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l022","ordinal":260564,"en":"Do it to him."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l023","ordinal":260565,"en":"If you have a handle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l024","ordinal":260566,"en":"Make a call."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l025","ordinal":260567,"en":"Kyla city Dingshan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l026","ordinal":260568,"en":"Forty tribes spoke Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0960:b003:l027","ordinal":26